.SH NOTES
UNIX\ V7 and several later systems have a list of baud rates
where after the values
.B B0
through
.B B9600
one finds the two constants
.BR EXTA ,
.B EXTB
("External A" and "External B").
Many systems extend the list with much higher baud rates.
